# Local development against an API running on your own machine:
#   Android emulator (host localhost):  http://10.0.2.2:5001
#   Physical device on the same LAN:    http://192.168.x.y:5001
#
# Note: https://igg084s4s08sk0w08gsc0cgk.tominho.com was an auto generated
# Coolify hostname. It no longer exists and answers 503. Do not use it.
